<title>EGYPT: Egypt overnight, one-week pound rates higher.</title>
<headline>Egypt overnight, one-week pound rates higher.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-09-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Average overnight interbank rates on the Egyptian pound in the private sector rose on Sunday in what bankers described as an illiquid market.</p>
<p>Overnight rates ranged from 10 to 10 5/8 percent, from between 10 and 10 7/16 percent on Thursday, they said.</p>
<p>There was little dealing at one-week rates but one banker quoted a rate of 10 5/8, compared with a range of between 10 1/16 and 10 7/16 percent on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
